            "description_html": "<b>NGP G610, Nylon Brush Perimeter Seal</b>\r\n<p>\r\nPerimeter door seal sold by the foot. Mounting housing made from Aluminum alloy 6063 T5 temper, and has slotted screw holes for easy adjustments. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nField sizable, quick easy installation. Packaged with installation screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for NGP G610 Vinyl Door Seal\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Width: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Nylon Brush Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Length: Optional by foot</li>\r\n<li>Nylon Brush Color: Black</li>\r\n<li>Screws: #6 x 3/4\" Stainless Steel SMS</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Certifications</b> for NGP G610 Nylon Brush Door Seal\r\n<ul>\r\n<li> CAN/ULC-S104</li>\r\n<li>ANSI/UL10B</li>\r\n<li>NFPA 80 and NFPA 252 for 3 hour hollow metal fire doors and 90 minute wood fire doors</li>\r\n<li>ANSI/UL10C for Positive Pressure</li>\r\n<li>IBC, NFPA 80 and NFPA 252 for 3 hour hollow metal fire doors  and 90 minute wood fire doors</li>\r\n\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold by the foot</b>\r\n</p>",
